  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "105",
  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "Under section 105, a signed blank cheque held as security and returned at the end of the tenancy is a security deposit, and a landlord is prohibited from collecting any security deposit other than a rent deposit under section 106. Because this requirement is inconsistent with section 105, the clause is void under section 4(1)."
}

